*.secret
!*.secret.example
# eDelivery URL files carry license-acceptance bearer tokens — never commit.
*.urls
# Env confs are per-site (hostnames, IPs, topology) — never commit; the repo
# ships only the commented example template. The installer is ./install.sh,
# whose wizard writes its own profiles under .conf/<name>/ (also gitignored).
*.conf
!*.conf.example
